## The similar-record hint a create prints on stderr (ADR 0038 §8)
similar-hint = Possibly the same as { $id } ({ $score }%)
similar-hint-compare = Possibly the same as { $id } ({ $score }%); compare: vitni match show { $kind } { $new } { $id }
similar-hint-failed = Could not look for similar records: { $error }
